B.I0=new A.hd("privacy","Privacy","The profile you type stays on this device until you delete it. EVA does not sell personal information and does not use the notes to train a model. If a Supabase project is configured at build time, the same profile is stored there. This public build has no such project. On-device storage is shared preferences, not a secure enclave, and this build has no role checks. Age is your own checkbox, not an identity check. An account password is stored on this device as a hash, not as the password itself, and this build does not email a reset link. A partner code links a view-only cycle line on this phone, and the copied message can be pasted on their phone. Stop sharing ends it here. Their copy lasts until the code expires. The message is not a copy of the notes.")
B.HZ=new A.hd("terms","Terms","EVA is educational guidance, not a medical device, not a diagnosis, and not contraception. It is not for emergencies. You make medical decisions with a clinician. You must be 16 or older.")
B.I2=new A.hd("cookies","Cookies","This build does not set advertising cookies and does not use a cookie banner for ads. The browser may keep the local profile in site storage so EVA can open again.")
B.HW=new A.hd("processing","Data processing","Purpose: show you the notes you chose to type. Lawful basis for health notes: your explicit consent. Recipients: this device, a partner phone when you copy the partner message onto it, and a Supabase project only when one was configured. The partner phone receives one cycle line, not the notes. Stop sharing ends access on this phone. A message already pasted stays on their phone until the code expires. A pending slot may briefly hold the newest save before it replaces the main copy.")
B.HX=new A.hd("health","Health data","Cycle notes, symptoms, and chat are health data. EVA stores them only after you confirm you are 16 or older and explicitly consent. EVA does not diagnose and does not provide treatment. Partner sharing is a separate one-time code. Their phone receives one cycle line, not the notes, and that line is not part of this consent.")
B.HY=new A.hd("retention","Retention","There is no timed expiry. Notes stay until you delete the profile. Withdrawal of consent stops new health notes and leaves existing notes in place until you delete them. A copy you already exported is yours to delete.")
B.I1=new A.hd("deletion","Account deletion","Delete removes the on-device profile, notes, shortcuts, consent record, and local session data, and EVA shows a deletion receipt. When Supabase is configured, the profile row is removed and the session is signed out. This app cannot delete an authentication user row created outside this device.")
B.I_=new A.hd("export","Export","Export copies the profile to your clipboard as the stored record. A download button saves the same JSON file when the browser allows it. You can save that copy as a file you control. That is the access and portability action. Correction is editing your own notes.")
B.HV=new A.hd("gdpr","GDPR","You can access, correct, export, and delete the profile in the app. You can withdraw consent. This build does not run a separate request desk. The rights are the buttons on this screen.")
B.HU=new A.hd("ccpa","CCPA","EVA does not sell personal information and does not share it for cross-context advertising. To opt out of storage, withdraw consent and delete the profile.")
B.q9=s([B.I0,B.HZ,B.I2,B.HW,B.HX,B.HY,B.I1,B.I_,B.HV,B.HU],A.ah("u<hd>"))
